# Claude Code's config dir inside the devcontainer (CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR).
# Local-only by default: credentials, transcripts, file history, caches,
# personal skills, plugin checkouts and installed_plugins.json.
# Committed: this file, settings.json, and the link to this project's memory
# (memory/ at the repo root).
*
!/.gitignore
!/settings.json
!/projects/
/projects/*
!/projects/@KEY@/
/projects/@KEY@/*
# The memory folder is a link to the repo's memory/ (long-term memory).
!/projects/@KEY@/memory
